# Dependencies
#
# The Feishu long connection needs @larksuiteoapi/node-sdk, installed beside the
# plugin rather than inside it — see README §安装 for why the host's realpath
# resolution makes the plugin's own node_modules the wrong place. Neither
# location is ever committed.
node_modules/
.npm-cache/
pnpm-lock.yaml
package-lock.json

# Credentials and runtime state
#
# The plugin keeps its credentials in the DSH data directory, never in the
# repository, but a stray copy here must not be committable either.
*.credentials.yaml
account.json
feishu.json
sync-buf.json
send-log.jsonl

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Local scratch
*.log
tmp/
